    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Revisiting your Vision\r\n\r\nYour webpage from earlier is back - now you can keep building it until it truly matches your vision! You get to decide how you want to work with AI Tutor as a collaborator.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n- Keep updating your webpage using AI Tutor as your collaborator.\r\n- Want to start over? Use the <i class=\"fa-history fa-solid\"></i> Version History tab to reset to the Initial Version\r\n\r\n**When to Continue?** This level isn't like earlier ones - there's no single task to complete here. You can spend _as much time as you want_ making updates to your webpage. You decide when you're done!\r\n\r\n> **Optional:** Use the **Share** button in the upper-left to send your page to a friend, or **Remix** to save it to your project gallery.",
